pt;\">재학생</span></u></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은고딕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">※ 단, 산업인턴생 및&nbsp;ICT학점연계 프로젝트 인턴십 참여자는 제외</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 맑은고딕; line-height: 1;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">▶&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간 :</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">2022. 12. 06.(화) ~ 2022. 12. 18.(일) 자정</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">까지</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 맑은고딕; line-height: 1;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">▶&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">신청서류</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&q